FORMAT = S4U_KV_v1
RECORD = NE_RC_RECORD_v1
EXPORT_STATUS = CERTIFIED
CLAIM = for N = 4 and every J >= 350, and for N = 3 and every J >= 300: Cov(s_e, s_f) > 0 for every pair of a top-row or bottom-row edge e with a horizontal or vertical edge f in NE's FLIP/SAME and MIXED classes on the horizontal chain: every two-sided class with n >= 5 (the 58 separated D0 pairs of P_3 x P_5 among them) and every class at infinity and far
CODE = kt_s8h_rcc_v1_5:e42435489ed535ba049c0d9ceb325cc8d98b01ad7e9c97ef17cbb66be48636ce
COVERAGE = per N and piece, the class keys of the COVER rows: FLIP/SAME H2 (dL, dR, kind), Hinf (dL, inf, kind), H1 (dL, far, kind) for dL, dR in DN = {'flip': (0, 1, 2), 'same': (0, 1)}; MIXED M2 HV (iH, dV, kind), Minf HV (iH, inf, kind), M1 HV (iH, far, kind) for iH in 0..T_M, dV in -1..T_M - 1, and Minf VH (dV, inf, kind), M1 VH (dV, far, kind), T_M = 3 at N = 4 and 2 at N = 3; kinds flip and same; rows for m < m0 with n >= 5 (n = dL + dR + m + 3 and iH + dV + m + 3), the top-mode form from m0 on, every m0 <= 8 (S8's KILL rule); the far rows by routes A and B; slots 0 and 1 from the exact entries, 2..7 and inf by RC; the bottom row as the parity mirror (F-a); every slot of DN (F-b)
